  "geometry_notes": [
    "The sheet does not dimension web width, top width, notch, flare or edge inset. The drawn flare (120 x 80) and inset (10) contradict the published properties. The fitted 120 x 60 flare and 15 mm inset reproduce them. The fitted values are implemented as the best estimate of the property basis, and the drawing values are recorded here.",
    "The notch was hypothesised as about 40 x 50 in Colin Caprani's 2026-09-22 review. It scales as 50 x 50, and the free fit gives 49.5 mm deep. 50 x 50 is used.",
    "M4 printed area 37860 is a dropped digit: 378600 closes exactly with the M3 to M4 step (+32000). The raw value is preserved.",
    "M10 table depth 360 conflicts with the explicit drawing label 1360. 1360 is used; the published Zt is consistent with 1360.",
    "M8 published Zt (87.87e6) is inconsistent with its own Zb and Yb: Zt*(D-Yb) exceeds Zb*Yb by 1.16%. The calculated Zt is 1.19% below. This is pinned.",
    "UK M-beam equivalence is unverified; no alias is provided."
